# Tower origin (no trailing slash). AVIF export POSTs a PNG to /api/v1/images/optimize; also used for auth/OAuth.
# Default: http://<TOWER_DEV_HOST>:<port> where port is TOWER_PORT (Beacon), else Tower apps/tower/.env `PORT`, else 3100.
# Production Webflow bundles default Tower to https://codalyn-tower.vercel.app (see vite.config). Override with `.env.production` — see `.env.production.example`.
# Override for staging/prod or non-default hosts:
# VITE_TOWER_ORIGIN=https://tower.example.com
# TOWER_DEV_HOST=localhost
# TOWER_PORT=3100

# Optional: match Tower `BEACON_API_KEY` for /api/v1 calls without a Tower session (e.g. AVIF). Prefer signing in via Webflow in the extension (session bearer).
# Client-visible in the bundle — dev/local only unless you accept exposing a site token.
VITE_BEACON_API_KEY=
